3. Create error handling
   - Use consistent format from L007
   - Handle all OAuth error cases from L002
...
```

## 🎯 Success Metrics

Good recommendations should:
- ✅ Surface 2-5 highly relevant lessons
- ✅ Match task requirements closely
- ✅ Provide actionable guidance
- ✅ Be referenced in the final plan
- ✅ Reduce implementation errors

Poor recommendations:
- ❌ Too many lessons (information overload)
- ❌ Irrelevant lessons (wrong module/context)
- ❌ Obvious/basic knowledge
- ❌ Never referenced in implementation
